The  device  driver  supports  the  Neterion Xframe‐I LR Ethernet
adapter, which uses a single mode fiber (1310nm) interface.   The
Xframe supports IPv4/TCP/UDP checksumming in hardware, as well as
TCP  Segmentation  Offloading  (TSO)  and hardware VLAN handling.
The driver currently does not support the hardware VLAN  feature.
